{
  "description": "Wire fixtures for events (contract: packages/h1/src/wire.rs in the manager worktree). Event/Frame/Request shapes are verbatim wire JSON. ts_ms and seq are placeholders: tests compare them only for presence and monotonic increase, never exact values. For relation_ended, app is the session that RECEIVES the event and detail.role is the role of the ENDED session in that edge.",
  "subscribe_request_filtered": { "op": "event_subscribe", "kinds": ["exited", "relation_ended"], "replay": false },
